e=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">참여를 희망하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청기간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;<b>2022. 8. 17.(수</b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) 09:00 ~ 2022. 9. 15.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) 18:00</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">시까지&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">※ 주말 및 공휴일 포함 신청기간 내 24시간 신청가능(단, 시작일 및 마감일 제외)</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청대상&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: 2022-2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기 국가근로장학사업 참여 희망 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청방법&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">한국장학재단 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(www.kosaf.go.kr)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">및 모바일 앱을 이용하여&nbsp;신청(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">첨부파일 매뉴얼 참조)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">희망근로기관 신청 및 선발 일정은 향후 학교 홈페이지 공고 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">-&nbsp;<b>2022학년도 동계방학 집중근로 프로그램</b>에 참여하고자 하는 경우, 반드시 2022학년도 2학기 학생신청 기간(1차 또는 2차)에 국가근로장학금을 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청기간에 국가근로장학사업 참여 신청을 하지 않을 경우 국가근로 참여 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">사정 및 일정에 따라 변경 가능</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">붙임&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학년도&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기 2차 국가근로장학금 학생신청 매뉴얼 각&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
